// 1. ONE QUESTION: "What is it called, and what is it?"
// 2. READERS: the administrator.
// 3. SERIES/SCALAR: scalars only — a name and a line of description.
// 4. IRREVERSIBLE: nothing; both are one edit back on the record.
// 5. CUT: everything else — the new record opens on its own page, where the
